*8 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Cadaver Bear]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
