==Strategy==
This is a Zombie/Metal stage, except the Metals aren't very strong. They're mostly here to prevent your cat units from pushing while the Zombies slowly advance towards your base. The main threats of this stage are the '''TWO''' 350% Cadaver Bears.

Because of how blatantly unfair this stage is, make sure your [[Shigong Cat]] is properly boosted. If it's underlevelled, either supplement him with Ubers or get his HP Talent. Equally as important as this is making sure your firepower is strong enough; letting both Cadaver Bears stack means almost certain death. [[Housewife Cat]], Talented [[Cataur]], and [[Awakened Musashi]] are going to be your main picks here. Make sure to add something for the Zories as well, like [[Cadaver BearCat]], or just use Holy Blast to force them to unburrow into your anti-Zombie stack.

===Recommended Ubers===
*Anti-Zombie nukers: [[Obliterator Diabolosa]], [[Ultra Atlantis Logistix]], and [[Eternal Reika]] are examples. In general, anything with Massive/Strong vs. Zombie and Zombie Killer will help here..

